    "long_instructions": "#### Debugging Practice\r\n\r\n1. Press each Vote button and watch the counts on this example site.\r\n2. Tell the AI what you expected, what happened instead, and where. \r\n3. Try the AI’s fix. If something is still wrong, tell the AI what to change next.\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it say what you expected, what happened, and where?",
